# Keep the Docker build context lean. This is shared by every image built with
# the repo root as context (docker/relay, docker/web). Everything excluded here
# is build output or local state that no image needs — the Go relay build and
# the pnpm web build both regenerate what they require.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/build
# TS incremental state: must not leak in, or composite deps "skip" emitting
# their dist/*.d.ts in the image and the web tsc fails with TS6305.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
bin
relay-data
*.log
